  "year": 2010,
  "pointsSystem": "Placement-equals-points (no points table). Each athlete's finish position in an event equals the points earned for that event (1st = 1 point, 2nd = 2, etc.); totalPoints is the sum across all nine events and the lowest total wins. Ties shared the better place value (e.g., two athletes tied for 1st each scored 1, and the next athlete scored 3). totalPoints equals the official leaderboard overall score for each athlete; points equal the per-event rank exactly.",
